@startuml 03_data_flow
title Data Flow: One Client Action from TCP Bytes to Broadcast

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangle<<planned>> {
  BackgroundColor #EEEEEE
  BorderColor #888888
  FontColor #666666
}

rectangle "Client socket" as Sock
rectangle "1. ReadFrame\nlength prefix, size cap, heartbeats dropped\n(transport/framing)" as R1
rectangle "2. DecodeClientMessage\nproto.Unmarshal into ClientMessage\n(transport/codec)" as R2
rectangle "3. State gate\nhandshake or dispatch by connection state\n(server/Client)" as R3
rectangle "4. Identity binding\nActorID = connection's player_id\nmembership check" as R4
rectangle "5. Session inbox\nserialized by the Session actor" as R5
rectangle "6. Match.ApplyAction\nActiveTurn, Validate, Apply\n(game plugin)" as R6
rectangle "7. Outcome check\nGame.Outcome(state)" as R7
rectangle "8. Per-recipient view\nGame.ViewFor(state, member)\nEncodeStateUpdate / EncodeMatchResult" as R8
rectangle "9. Client.out queue\nnon-blocking Send" as R9
rectangle "10. writeLoop\nWriteFrame with write deadline" as R10
rectangle "Client sockets\n(every session member)" as Out
rectangle "Action log and result write\n(single transaction)" as R11 <<planned>>
rectangle "Structured log\n(accepted and rejected actions)" as R12 <<planned>>
database "Authoritative GameState\n(held only by Match)" as GS

Sock --> R1 : bytes
R1 --> R2 : payload []byte
R2 --> R3 : ClientMessage
R3 --> R4 : ActionRequest
R4 --> R5 : game.Action
R5 --> R6 : game.Action
R6 <--> GS : read, replace with new state
R6 --> R7 : accepted
R6 --> R9 : ErrorResponse to sender only\n(rejected, state unchanged)
R7 --> R8 : state, terminal flag
R8 --> R9 : encoded frame per member
R9 --> R10 : []byte
R10 --> Out : frames
R7 ..> R11 : terminal match
R6 ..> R12 : every action
R3 --> R9 : handshake and state errors
@enduml
